            <ArticleTitle>Postsurgical Management of Differentiated Thyroid Cancer in China.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1043-2760(17)30140-6</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.tem.2017.10.008</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postsurgical management of differentiated thyroid cancer in China has gained a great success in the last twenty years, but there are still gaps to be filled. Here, we briefly review the current status and also extend an outlook for future development.</AbstractText>
